<section class="wrap" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">/ Why</p>
  <h2 id="why-title">Coverage measures execution, not verification.</h2>
  <p class="lead">Teams ship a lot of AI-generated code, and agents write tests that pass. The mutation score tells you whether those tests protect behavior. Time keeps it out of pull requests: a full run takes 40 to 90 minutes. Reapr scopes it to the diff.</p>
  <dl class="ledger">
    <div>
      <dt>Line coverage asks</dt>
      <dd>Did a test run this line?<span class="answer">yes, 100%</span></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>The mutation score asks</dt>
      <dd>If this line changed, would a test fail?<span class="answer">no, it survived</span></dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>
